{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42131","headline":"和王庶子寄题兄长建州廉使新亭 · 徐铉","name":"和王庶子寄题兄长建州廉使新亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谢守高斋结构新，一方风景万家情。\n羣贤讵减山阴会，远俗初闻正始声。\n水槛片云长不去，讼庭纤草转应生。\n阿连诗句偏多思，遥想池塘昼梦成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42131.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42131","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}